flowchart TB
    A[Delete Request] --> B[Pin Policy]
    B --> C{Legal Hold Active?}
    C -- Yes --> D[Refuse Delete]
    C -- Unknown --> E[Defer / Escalate]
    C -- No --> F{Retention Active?}
    F -- Yes --> D
    F -- Unknown --> E
    F -- No --> G{Replay Coverage 100%?}
    G -- No --> H[Freeze Hard Delete]
    G -- Yes --> I[Delete + deleteReceiptId]
